子の方の髪は、3つ目のリンクにあるようになります。\n\n​\n\nhttps://picrew.me/share?cd=9X3iHviMmO\n\nhttps://bbs.tunaground.net/upload/image/1599290064545-339593797----.jpg\n\nhttp://li.nu/attrade/item.php?id=11177603", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@CP_komac/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 612265, "client_id": 337334, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/524845f3/requests/142536_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=947390ccbb643662ede1001ed4e722c8", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/524845f3/requests/142536_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=947390ccbb643662ede1001ed4e722c8, https://si.imgix.net/524845f3/requests/142536_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=59cb5f69c99d78e9e4474f4919e13f1b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/524845f3/requests/142536_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fc2cf357e258606aea87be615fb63165 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/524845f3/requests/142536_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=15efd80fe1d6073c46754e92331f4ad6", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/524845f3/requests/142536_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=15efd80fe1d6073c46754e92331f4ad6, https://si.imgix.net/524845f3/requests/142536_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=94bed0af123a36f55e960758cc1f9090 2x, https://si.imgix.net/524845f3/requests/142536_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5b52b95c4182f1def4c8c8b96fad3438 3x"}, "body": "紫ちゃま（藍ちゃま状態の紫）と通常サイズの藍・橙でお願いします。", "nc": 145, "word_count": 